2. Maia-3 Components & Derivatives (GNU AGPLv3)
-----------------------------------------------
The Maia-3 neural network architecture and derived Float32 weight exports originate
from the Maia Chess / CSSLab Maia-3 project (University of Toronto & Carnegie Mellon University).
Upstream repository: https://github.com/CSSLab/maia3
Licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 (AGPL-3.0).
See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for complete details, upstream commit references,
conversion script instructions, and corresponding source access.

3. Stockfish WebAssembly Engine (GNU GPLv3)
-------------------------------------------
Stockfish is an open-source UCI chess engine developed by the Stockfish developers.
The WebAssembly compilation and wrapper files (lib/stockfish-19.js, lib/stockfish.wasm)
are licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0 (GPL-3.0).
Upstream repository: https://github.com/official-stockfish/Stockfish
See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for details and source code acquisition instructions.
